---
import Header from "@/components/Header.astro";
import Footer from "@/components/Footer.astro";
import Breadcrumb from "@/components/Breadcrumb.astro";
import Layout from "@/layouts/Layout.astro";
import { SITE } from "@/config";
---

<Layout
  title={`Terms of Service · Pourveyor | ${SITE.title}`}
  description="Ramon Claudio, LLC · Pourveyor Terms of Service"
>
  <Header />
  <Breadcrumb />
  <main id="main-content">
    <section class="app-prose mb-28 max-w-app prose-img:border-0">
      <h1 class="text-2xl tracking-wider sm:text-3xl">Terms of Service</h1>
      <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">Ramon Claudio, LLC · Pourveyor</p>
      <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">Last Updated: July 30, 2026</p>

      <p>
        These Terms of Service ("Terms") govern your use of the Pourveyor mobile
        application operated by Ramon Claudio, LLC ("we," "our," or "us"). By
        using Pourveyor, you agree to these Terms.
      </p>

      <h3>About Pourveyor</h3>
      <p>
        Pourveyor is a curated guide to specialty coffee shops in New York City.
        The list is editorial. Shops are chosen by us, and the pick and the
        reason attached to each one are our opinion, not a professional
        recommendation or a rating.
      </p>

      <h3>Shop Information</h3>
      <p>
        Addresses, hours, phone numbers, and other details are gathered from
        public sources and can go out of date. Shops close, move, and change
        their hours without telling us. Check with the shop before you travel.
        We do not guarantee that any listing is current, complete, or accurate.
      </p>

      <h3>No Affiliation or Endorsement</h3>
      <p>
        We are not affiliated with, sponsored by, or endorsed by any shop or
        roaster listed in the app. Shop names, logos, and trademarks belong to
        their respective owners and appear for identification only. Appearing in
        the app is not a paid placement, and we accept no payment for inclusion.
      </p>

      <h3>Account Registration</h3>
      <p>
        Browsing does not require an account. If you create one, you must
        provide accurate information and you are responsible for maintaining the
        security of your credentials. You must be at least 13 years old to
        create an account.
      </p>

      <h3>Acceptable Use</h3>
      <p>You agree not to:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Use the app for any unlawful purpose</li>
        <li>Attempt to gain unauthorized access to the app or its systems</li>
        <li>Interfere with or disrupt the app or its infrastructure</li>
        <li>Impersonate any person or entity</li>
        <li>Use the app to harass, abuse, or harm others</li>
        <li>
          Scrape, bulk-copy, or redistribute the shop list or the editorial
          write-ups
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h3>Intellectual Property</h3>
      <p>
        The Pourveyor name, brand, App Store listing, app design, and the
        editorial write-ups are owned by Ramon Claudio, LLC. Nothing in these
        Terms grants you a license to reuse any of them.
      </p>

      <h3>Termination</h3>
      <p>
        We reserve the right to suspend or terminate your account if you violate
        these Terms. You may delete your account at any time from Profile, which
        removes your data after a 30-day grace window.
      </p>

      <h3>Disclaimer of Warranties</h3>
      <p>
        Pourveyor is provided "as is" and "as available" without warranties of
        any kind, either express or implied. We do not guarantee that the app
        will be uninterrupted, error-free, or secure, or that any shop listing
        is accurate or current.
      </p>

      <h3>Limitation of Liability</h3>
      <p>
        To the maximum extent permitted by law, Ramon Claudio, LLC shall not be
        liable for any indirect, incidental, special, consequential, or punitive
        damages arising from your use of the app, including any wasted trip to a
        shop that has closed, moved, or changed its hours.
      </p>

      <h3>Governing Law</h3>
      <p>
        These Terms are governed by the laws of the State of New York, without
        regard to its conflict of law provisions.
      </p>

      <h3>Changes to These Terms</h3>
      <p>
        We may update these Terms from time to time. Continued use of the app
        after changes constitutes acceptance of the updated Terms.
      </p>

      <h3>Contact Us</h3>
      <p>
        If you have questions about these Terms, contact us at
        <a href="mailto:team@rmncldyo.com">team@rmncldyo.com</a>.
      </p>
    </section>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>
